1. Refactor engine loop to item-based command/result routing
    [X] 'content/core/engine.py': Restructure run() to item-cycle pattern
        - while True loop, break on ExitCommand
        - if item is None: item = frontend.get_request()
        - match item: dispatch BootCmd, ClankerizeCmd, RenderPromptCmd, ExitCommand (break), Command -> kb_service.handle_cmd
        - if isinstance(item, Result): frontend.post_response(item); item = None
        - removed the old isinstance(command_result, PromptRenderPending) special-case block
        - return item.exit_msg after break
    [X] 'content/core/engine_deps/result.py': Added RenderPromptCmd(Command) carrying ctx, btn, kb, ui_render, cmd
        - removed PromptRenderPending
        - removed ExitResult
        - PromptService.render_prompt signature changed to (cmd: RenderPromptCmd) -> PromptRenderResult
        - KBService.handle_cmd return type updated to Result | RenderPromptCmd
    [X] 'content/modules/keyboard/keyboard_service.py': _handle_prompt_btn returns RenderPromptCmd
        - removed ExitCommand case from handle_cmd match
        - cleaned imports
